 "notes": [
  "Restatement of comparatives: this release moves the 2019 $57m cost of early repayment of Senior Notes out of 'Interest expense, net' into a new line 'Loss on extinguishment of debt' (Q4-19 interest now 36, FY2019 141). Prior-year segment expenses/OP are also recast vs the 2019 releases (e.g. Q4-19 Ratings OP 478 vs 473 originally; FY2019 Ratings 1,783 vs 1,763); segment totals unchanged.",
  "Exhibit 5 is titled 'Operating Results by Segment - Reported vs. Performance' and includes an 'Adjusted Expenses' table.",
  "No Exhibit 8 guidance reconciliation: the company gives no FY2021 GAAP guidance because of the pending IHS Markit merger (S-4 effective 22-Jan-2021; shareholder votes 11-Mar-2021).",
  "Lease-related costs (non-impairment) are categorised OTHER; lease and technology impairments IMPAIR; IHS Markit merger costs ACQ.",
  "Non-GAAP after-tax footnote amounts do not tie to the aggregate 'Non-GAAP adjustments' after-tax line in Exhibit 5 (the release itself does not tie; possibly the NCI share of Indices items and rounding). Published numbers kept; items_total_net is the printed aggregate.",
  "'Other (income) expense, net' (16) -> income -> oth_inc = +16. Loss on extinguishment of debt: 0 in Q4-20 (recorded in other_lines).",
  "Non-GAAP adjustments Q4-20: OP 218 (RAT 14, MI 29, Platts 13, Indices 12, Corporate 150), tax 35, after tax 178 ($0.74). Footnote after-tax items sum to 167 (171 operating items less $4m tax benefit, computed) vs 178 printed; pre-tax 218 less tax adjustment 35 = 183 (computed). check_rec 'start_ni + items_net + amort = adj_ni' fails: 454 + 167 + 22 = 643 vs 654 published. Corporate footnote items sum to 151 (2+9+116+24) vs 150 printed.",
  "Adjusted total expense (company note) 964 for Q4-2020.",
  "Indices Adjusted Net Operating Profit (attributable to the Company) = 131 (adj OP 176 less NCI 45).",
  "Cash flow / FCF printed for twelve months only (ytd 12)."
 ],
